#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:5
#: 52232daeda554a20a44c87a48094b701
msgid "Companion Computers for Sub"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:7
#: 48cec8b8088b45d0b68a2b91c6b0a425
msgid "Underwater ROVs often employ a small companion computer, in addition to the :ref:`ArduPilot autopilot <common-autopilots>` to manage video cameras and sophisticated peripherals like SideScan Sonar as an adjunct to ArduPilot's basic vehicle control and mission execution functions. Companion computers communicate with the autopilot over a fast link, often a UART, using MAVLink messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:9
#: 43601679cb6e4a93b4bd2fd5fae86d62
msgid "ArduPilot compatible companion computers are listed :ref:`HERE <companion-computers>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:11
#: 6ee0e0e742a8418db5eae056465a1bbc
msgid "`Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/>`__ offers a highly functional, open source, companion computer firmware system that runs on a `Raspberry Pi 3, 4, or 5 <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__ for vehicles called `BlueOS <https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__."
msgstr ""
